transition-colors hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white" href="/api-keys">Claves de API</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white/85 transition-colors hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white" href="https://docs.lumenwipe.com">Documentación<span class="sr-only"> (se abre en una pestaña nueva)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-fg-muted" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white/85 transition-colors hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white" href="https://github.com/LumenWipe/lumenwipe">GitHub<span class="sr-only"> (se abre en una pestaña nueva)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-fg-muted" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/" hrefLang="en" lang="en" class="items-center text-fg-muted underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-white hover:underline hidden lg:inline-flex">English</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-control font-semibold transition-colors duration-fast ease-standard disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 border border-line-strong text-fg not-disabled:hover:bg-surface-raised not-disabled:active:bg-surface min-h-control px-3 text-xs md:min-h-9 whitespace-nowrap" href="/mainnet">Abrir la app</a><button type="button" aria-label="Abri